OL,3,GNEWSACoffee shop reaps rewards of
OL,4,AAlbion's flying form
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coffee shop has been reaping the
OL,7,Frewards of Brighton & Hove Albion's
OL,8,Frich vein of form with players
OL,9,Fpurchasing rounds to celebrate clean
OL,10,Fsheets.
OL,12,FThe Flour Pot Bakery in Brighton said
OL,13,Fit had been invited to the training
OL,14,Fground to serve first team players
OL,15,F"every week for the past six weeks" and
OL,16,Fgoalkeeper Bart Verbruggen was the one
OL,17,Fto foot the bill.
OL,19,FMariana Katsouris, from the bakery,
OL,20,Ftold BBC Radio Sussex: "He always likes
OL,21,Fto treat the team and everyone else."
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
