OL,3,GNEWSACoffee shop reaps rewards of
OL,4,AAlbion's flying form
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Seagulls currently sit third in the
OL,7,FPremier League, with Sunday's
OL,8,Fresounding 5-0 win over rivals Crystal
OL,9,FPalace their fourth match in a row
OL,10,Fwithout conceding in all competitions.
